  "wikitext": "{|class=\"wikitable\" style=\"float:right;max-width: 35%;\"\n!colspan=\"2\"| Cost\n|-\n|'''Cost''' || $325, 2,500x [[wood]],</br> 100x [[steel]]\n|-\n|'''Total Cost''' || $1500\n|-\n!colspan=\"2\"| Production\n|-\n|'''Inputs''' || 8x [[crude oil]]\n|-\n|'''Outputs''' || 1x [[rubber]]\n|-\n|'''Production interval''' || 40 seconds\n|-\n|'''Production/Hour''' || 90x [[rubber]]\n|-\n!colspan=\"2\"| Production\n|-\n|'''Profit/Min''' || $10.50\n|-\n|'''Profit/Hour''' || $630.00\n|-\n|'''Return On Investment''' || 0.62%\n|-\n|'''Time to ROI || 161.29 Minutes </br>(~2:30 hours)\n|-\n!colspan=\"2\"| Aliases\n|-\n|colspan=\"2\"| rubber factory, rubberfactory, rubber plant, </br>rubberplant, rubber fac\n|}\n[[Category:Facility]]\n\nThe rubber factory is a facility that produces 1x [[rubber]] every 40 seconds.\n\nYou need the output of 1/5 of an [[Oil well]] to fully sustain this. In other words, You can run 5 rubber factory from 1 [[Oil well]]\n\n== Related facilities ==\n'''As construction material'''\n*[[Gas station]]\n*[[Aluminum factory]]\n*[[Bicycle factory]]\n*[[Lamp factory]]\n*[[Plastic factory]]\n*[[Research chemical factory]]\n*[[Television factory]]\n*[[Gasoline engine factory]]\n*[[Car factory]]\n*[[Prescription drug factory]]\n\n'''As input'''\n*[[Bicycle factory]]\n*[[Gasoline engine factory]]\n*[[Car factory]]",
